# /etc/fw_env.config — libubootenv configuration for KR260
#
# Specifies where the U-Boot environment is stored so that fw_setenv /
# fw_printenv can read and write it from Linux.
#
# On KR260 the microSD is /dev/mmcblk1.  The Xilinx U-Boot build for KR260
# (from meta-kria) uses CONFIG_ENV_IS_IN_FAT=y by default, which stores the
# env as a file named "uboot.env" in the FAT boot partition (p1).
#
# Format: device  offset  size  sector-size  [num-copies]
#
# For FAT-based env (default for Kria SD boot):
/dev/mmcblk1p1  0x0  0x20000  0x200  1
#
# If your U-Boot is configured with CONFIG_ENV_IS_IN_MMC (raw sector offset),
# replace the line above with something like:
#   /dev/mmcblk1  0x1F40000  0x40000  0x200  1
# Verify the exact offset in the U-Boot build for meta-kria rel-v2025.2.
